                                "sense_id": "d0e33dc6-0a05-3d3d-b73e-7b72b7d794fd",
                                "text": "Es war beeindruckend: Korrekt formulierte Sätze, ein aufmerksames Abwägen der Argumente und ein festgelegtes Zeitfenster, über dessen Einhaltung ein Saalordner mit Handglocke wachte.",
                                "translation": "It was impressive: Correctly worded sentences, careful consideration of the arguments and a fixed time window, which was observed by a room steward with a handbell.",
                                "english": "It was impressive: Correctly worded sentences, careful consideration of the arguments and a fixed time window, which was observed by a room steward with a handbell."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a908057-b17e-4d9a-926f-83e3ec43ec61",
                                "sense_id": "d0e33dc6-0a05-3d3d-b73e-7b72b7d794fd",
                                "text": "Die mit Handglocke und lautstarker Stimme verkündeten, wann die Stadttore zu öffnen und zu schließen sind oder was die Landesfürsten ihren...",
                                "translation": "With a handbell and a loud voice, they announced when the city gates were to be opened and closed or what the sovereigns were doing for their...",
